{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0322-coin-change","title":"LeetCode 322 零钱兑换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0322-coin-change","wordCount":856,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-322-零钱兑换\">LeetCode 322 零钱兑换</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>coins</code>，表示不同面额的硬币；以及一个整数 <code>amount</code>，表示总金额。</p>\n<p>计算并返回可以凑成总金额所需的最少的硬币个数。如果没有任何一种硬币组合能组成总金额，返回 -1。</p>\n<p>你可以认为每种硬币的数量是无限的。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ coins.length ≤ 12</li>\n<li>1 ≤ coins[i] ≤ 2³¹ - 1</li>\n<li>0 ≤ amount ≤ 10⁴</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：coins = [1, 2, 5], amount = 11输出：3解释：11 = 5 + 5 + 1</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：coins = [2], amount = 3输出：-1</p>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：coins = [1], amount = 0输出：0</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是经典的<strong>完全背包问题</strong>。每种硬币可以无限使用，目标是用最少的硬币凑出目标金额。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义</strong>：<code>dp[i]</code> 表示凑成金额 <code>i</code> 所需的最少硬币数。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：对于每个金额 <code>i</code>，遍历每种硬币面额 <code>coin</code>，如果 <code>i &gt;= coin</code>，则 <code>dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1)</code>。</p>\n<p>直觉理解：要凑出金额 <code>i</code>，可以选择最后一枚硬币为 <code>coin</code>，那么问题转化为凑出 <code>i - coin</code> 需要多少枚硬币。枚举所有可能的&quot;最后一枚硬币&quot;，取最小值。</p>\n<p><strong>贪心不可行</strong>：贪心策略（总是优先使用最大面额）在很多情况下会失败。例如 <code>coins = [1, 3, 4]</code>, <code>amount = 6</code>，贪心给出 <code>4+1+1 = 3</code> 枚，但最优解是 <code>3+3 = 2</code> 枚。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力递归</td>\n<td>O(amount^n)</td>\n<td>O(amount)</td>\n<td>n 为硬币种类数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆化搜索</td>\n<td>O(amount × n)</td>\n<td>O(amount)</td>\n<td>自顶向下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划</td>\n<td>O(amount × n)</td>\n<td>O(amount)</td>\n<td>自底向上，最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function coinChange(coins: number[], amount: number): number {&#10;  const dp = new Array(amount + 1).fill(Infinity);&#10;  dp[0] = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= amount; i++) {&#10;    for (const coin of coins) {&#10;      if (i &gt;= coin &amp;&amp; dp[i - coin] !== Infinity) {&#10;        dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[amount] === Infinity ? -1 : dp[amount];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> coinChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">coins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coins) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[i], dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[amount] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[amount];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[0] = 0</code>：凑成金额 0 不需要任何硬币</li>\n<li><code>dp[i]</code> 初始为 <code>Infinity</code>：表示尚未找到凑成方案</li>\n<li>对每个金额 <code>i</code>，遍历所有硬币面额 <code>coin</code></li>\n<li><code>dp[i - coin] + 1</code>：使用一枚面额为 <code>coin</code> 的硬币后，加上凑成 <code>i - coin</code> 的最少硬币数</li>\n<li>如果 <code>dp[i - coin]</code> 为 <code>Infinity</code>，说明 <code>i - coin</code> 无法凑成，跳过</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>另一种遍历顺序——按硬币种类遍历在外层：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function coinChangeAlt(coins: number[], amount: number): number {&#10;  const dp = new Array(amount + 1).fill(Infinity);&#10;  dp[0] = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const coin of coins) {&#10;    for (let i = coin; i &lt;= amount; i++) {&#10;      if (dp[i - coin] !== Infinity) {&#10;        dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[amount] === Infinity ? -1 : dp[amount];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> coinChangeAlt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">coins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coins) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[i], dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[amount] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[amount];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种遍历顺序对本题（求最少硬币数）的结果相同。但在&quot;求组合数&quot;的变体（LC #518 零钱兑换 II）中，遍历顺序会影响结果——硬币在外层防止重复计数。</p>\n<p><strong>模拟执行（coins = [1, 2, 5], amount = 11）：</strong></p>\n<p>dp 初始: [0, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞, ∞]</p>\n<ul>\n<li>i=1: dp[1]=min(∞, dp[0]+1)=1</li>\n<li>i=2: dp[2]=min(dp[1]+1, dp[0]+1)=1</li>\n<li>i=3: dp[3]=min(dp[2]+1, dp[1]+1)=2</li>\n<li>i=5: dp[5]=min(dp[4]+1, dp[3]+1, dp[0]+1)=1</li>\n<li>...</li>\n<li>i=11: dp[11]=3 (5+5+1)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>完全背包与 0-1 背包的区别：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>0-1 背包</th>\n<th>完全背包</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每个物品使用次数</td>\n<td>最多 1 次</td>\n<td>无限次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内层遍历方向</td>\n<td>从大到小（逆序）</td>\n<td>从小到大（正序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表题目</td>\n<td>LC #416</td>\n<td>LC #322</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>完全背包中内层正序遍历，是因为 <code>dp[i - coin]</code> 可能已经包含了当前这枚硬币的使用（正序意味着同一轮循环中可以重复使用）。0-1 背包中逆序遍历确保每个物品只使用一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(amount × n)</td>\n<td>amount 为目标金额，n 为硬币种类数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(amount)</td>\n<td>dp 数组大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题是完全背包的基础模板。掌握&quot;dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i-coin]+1)&quot;的转移方程和正序遍历的含义后，可以直接应用于 LC #518（零钱兑换 II，求组合数）、LC #279（完全平方数）等完全背包变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 322 零钱兑换","id":"leetcode-322-零钱兑换"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 300 最长递增子序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0300-longest-increasing-subsequence"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 215 数组中的第 K 个最大元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0215-kth-largest-element"}}